 {
  id="hun-beast-mastery-mobalytics-kargoz",
  spec="Beast Mastery",
  label="Beast Mastery · Mobalytics · Kargoz lv 10-60 31/20/0",
  kind="exact-order",
  default=true,
  note="Exact point order from the guide. Source notes: Valid vs row rules and prerequisites. Lone Wolf (54) gives nothing while the pet is out; the author himself recommends swapping it for Rapid Killing 2/2. Mobalytics' embedded calculator still lists a stale 'Improved Serpent Sting' (5 ranks) in Marksmanship that is not in the verified Forever tree (0 points spent there). Its first 21 points match Crix's Mobalytics BM 1-30 guide, except Crix's level",
  priorities="31/20/0. Per-level list: Deadly Aspects 5 (10-14), Focused Fire 2, Pathfinding 2, Improved Revive Pet 1 (flex), Bestial Swiftness, Unleashed Fury 4, Summon Hawk at 25 (big spike), Unleashed Fury 5/5, Ferocity 3, Intimidation at 30, Ferocity 5/5, Bestial Discipline 2, Frenzy 4, Spirit Bond 1 (flex), Bestial Wrath at 40; then MM: Lethal Attacks 5, Hawk Eye 3, Careful Aim 5, Lone Wolf, Rapid Killing 1, Mortal Shots 5. Author says Endurance Training is an equal alternative to Deadly Aspects for a tankier pet, and he would swap the Lone Wolf point for a 2nd Rapid Killing rank.",
